Pomelo v3 phone tools on top of the v2 series.

Vertical tabs are eligible on phones and on by default until the user chooses
otherwise. The task manager feature is enabled. The Android side panel, which
hosts extension side panels, is enabled.

More tools gains Notes (a local pad), Sessions (save and reopen the current
tabs), and Sync server (a Chromium sync URL applied as --sync-url on the next
start). Docked DevTools is not in this patch: the phone frontend still opens
through DevToolsWindow::OpenDevToolsWindow.

